WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.415
Run the capture script.

2
00:00:02.465 --> 00:00:07.028
It starts the app once for each registered screen,

3
00:00:07.078 --> 00:00:13.549
passing the screen id as an intent extra, and takes a screenshot with adb.

4
00:00:13.599 --> 00:00:15.537
When it finishes,

5
00:00:15.587 --> 00:00:21.552
.scry/capture holds one image per screen and a small manifest file.

